n and steals a few euros here and there from all those lovely people she looks after with such devotion, and who adore her for it… But after an accusation of abuse of a vulnerable person, Maria winds up in police custody.","tagline":"When a grandmother's love for her grandson pushes her over the line."},{"language":"fr-FR","overview":"Maria n’est plus toute jeune et aide des personnes plus âgées qu’elle. Tirant le diable par la queue, elle ne se résout pas à sa précaire condition et, par-ci par-là, vole quelques euros à tous ces braves gens dont elle s’occupe avec une dévotion extrême... et qui, pour cela, l’adorent... Pourtant une plainte pour abus de faiblesse conduira Maria en garde à vue...","tagline":"Quand l'amour d'une grand-mère pour son petit-fils la pousse à franchir les limites."}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xHPCnfQ68xLVuXGtN5QynTNqUzj.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xHPCnfQ68xLVuXGtN5QynTNqUzj.png","language":"fr","width":1850,"height":569}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9VtUkzIuzHeJ8SlnSzFPISNl72Q.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9VtUkzIuzHeJ8SlnSzFPISNl72Q.jpg","language":"it","width":952,"height":1429},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/b0iYxAyB8dnyWBtF3NQwF23wGfB.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/b0iYxAyB8dnyWBtF3NQwF23wGfB.jpg","language":"it","width":1904,"height":2858},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lvNpUwVOlj9hoY0JiH5b5OHh9SJ.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lvNpUwVOlj9hoY0JiH5b5OHh9SJ.jpg","language":"fr","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/a85W6aAt2Akixz71mLGNpSIaVv4.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/a85W6aAt2Akixz71mLGNpSIaVv4.jpg","language":"fr","width":500,"height":750},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iKUYKuyzsL3Ka6M891Vh1REGRQC.jpg